## Executive Summary

The Asia Pacific region represents Nexus Industries' largest growth opportunity, with $1.52B in FY2025 revenue (18% of total) and potential to grow to $3.5B by 2030 (23% of total). This strategy outlines our investment priorities, market entry approaches, and organizational development to capture this opportunity.

