## Strategic Initiatives

### Initiative 1: India Market Entry

**Investment:** $85M over 5 years
**Revenue Target:** $350M by 2030

| Element | Approach |
|---------|----------|
| Entity | Wholly-owned subsidiary |
| Location | Bangalore (tech), Chennai (manufacturing) |
| Products | IoT platform, energy systems, aerospace components |
| Headcount | 800 by 2030 |

**Milestones:**
| Year | Revenue | Employees | Key Actions |
|------|---------|-----------|-------------|
| 2026 | $85M | 180 | Office, initial team |
| 2027 | $145M | 320 | Manufacturing pilot |
| 2028 | $220M | 520 | Full operations |
| 2029 | $285M | 680 | Scale-up |
